  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Jane Mance is a footwear businesswoman and director of Nokwol UK. She previously held a substantial ownership interest in Golden Wolfe, a British company supporting related shoe businesses. Nokwol designs its footwear in London and sells through its own shops and other retailers, drawing on an Australian family business background.",
