  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "Footwear businesswoman Jane Mance encountered the practical demands of entering a new market when she and Craig Mance expanded their Hong Kong operation into Britain. They wanted an adviser familiar with both jurisdictions, and selected Jamie Morrison at HW Fisher to help establish the British side of the business.\n\nMorrison arranged the company setup, payroll and insurance, as well as advising on tax and VAT. The Mances valued prompt responses while working across countries. His assistance also covered banking arrangements and putting them in contact with lawyers who could handle property matters.",
    "html": "<p>Footwear businesswoman Jane Mance encountered the practical demands of entering a new market when she and Craig Mance expanded their Hong Kong operation into Britain. They wanted an adviser familiar with both jurisdictions, and selected Jamie Morrison at HW Fisher to help establish the British side of the business.</p>\r\n<p>Morrison arranged the company setup, payroll and insurance, as well as advising on tax and VAT. The Mances valued prompt responses while working across countries. His assistance also covered banking arrangements and putting them in contact with lawyers who could handle property matters.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 92,
